-- Granular Distribution: Item Count per Order Grouped by Day of Week
SELECT 
    o.order_id,
    o.order_dow,
    COUNT(op.product_id) AS items_per_order
FROM order_products op
JOIN orders o ON op.order_id = o.order_id
GROUP BY o.order_id, o.order_dow;
```

**Finding:** Average basket size doesn't change much by specific days with no visible trend. Average basket size for all days is around 10 items.

