## Summary of Insights & Recommendations
* **Workforce Optimization:** Align picker/driver shift schedules with the hourly staffing tier matrix—ramping up capacity during late-morning to mid-afternoon peak windows on Sundays and Mondays while scaling down during off-peak overnight hours.
* **Stock-Up vs. Fill-In Promotions:** Target weekend stock-up shoppers with bulk bundle discounts and minimum-spend promotions, while using mid-week push notifications to capture quick fill-in orders.
* **Retention & Merchandising:** Surface high-retention staple SKUs (`>1,000` orders and top reorder rates) and top-3 department leaders in "Buy It Again" checkout prompts to streamline repeat ordering.

